      "text": "HEADMASTER DASHBOARD — DESKTOP\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ TOP BAR: [Novastar Logo]  [Search]  [Notifications🔔]  [👤] │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ QUICK STATS BAR (5 cards)                                  │\n│ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌────┐ │\n│ │ 👥 542   │ │ 👨‍🏫 48   │ │ 💰 78%   │ │ ✅ 94%   │ │ ⚠️ 12│ │\n│ │ Students │ │ Staff    │ │ Fees     │ │ Attend.  │ │Alerts│ │\n│ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ └──────────┘ └────┘ │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ RECENT ACTIVITY          │ FINANCE SNAPSHOT    │ ACAD HEALTH│\n│ ┌────────────────────┐   │ ┌────────────────┐ │ ┌────────┐ │\n│ │ 🟢 New admission   │   │ │ Term 2 Fees    │ │ │ 3B: 82%│ │\n│ │    Ama Asante      │   │ │ Due: GHS 245K  │ │ │ 2A: 78%│ │\n│ │ 🟢 Staff hired     │   │ │ Collected:78%  │ │ │ 1B: 85%│ │\n│ │ 🔵 Fee payment     │   │ │ Outstanding:54K│ │ │ 4C: 71%│ │\n│ │ 🟡 SBA submitted   │   │ │ MoMo Pending:8K│ │ │ SBA: 87%│ │\n│ │ 🔴 3 absent >5d    │   │ └────────────────┘ │ │ Promo: 12│ │\n│ └────────────────────┘   │                    │ └────────┘ │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ ALERTS & ACTIONS REQUIRED                                │\n│ ⚠️ 5 teachers: NTC license expiring < 30 days            │\n│ ⚠️ 12 students: Fee overdue > 60 days                    │\n│ ⚠️ 3 classes: No published timetable for Term 2          │\n│ ⚠️ SBA Term 2 deadline in 3 days (4 teachers pending)    │\n│ ⚠️ 2 staff: Leave requests pending approval              │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ QUICK ACTIONS                                            │\n│ [New Student] [New Staff] [Send Broadcast] [Generate Rpt]│\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘",
